NOMOS Artifacts — Licensing
===========================

This package contains two kinds of material under two licenses.

1. DATA AND DOCUMENTS
   Applies to: policies/, rules/, logs/, results/, and all .json / .jsonl /
   .csv / .md files describing rule sets, policies, reports, block logs, and
   results.
   License: Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International (CC BY-NC 4.0).
   You may share and adapt this material for non-commercial purposes, provided you give
   appropriate credit to the paper "NOMOS: Compiling Written Policies into Statically Verified Tool-Call Gates for LLM Agents" (Yu, Kim, and Choi).
   Full text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/legalcode

2. ANALYSIS SCRIPTS
   Applies to: scripts/*.py
   License: Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International
   (CC BY-NC 4.0), the same as the data above.

