   You may use, share, and adapt these scripts for non-commercial purposes,
   provided you give appropriate credit. The scripts are provided "as is",
   without warranty of any kind; the authors are not liable for any claim,
   damages, or other liability arising from their use.
   Full text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/legalcode

The proprietary compiler (including its LLM extraction prompt) and the runtime
gate implementation are NOT included in this package and are NOT licensed here.
